WEBVTT

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:06.650
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY
MOBILE SUIT</b>

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:29.160
The Reineforce Junior, having struck...

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:33.700
...the Zanscare Empire's main fleet with the Big Cannon, is left exhausted.

00:01:34.930 --> 00:01:38.830
While they retreated, as they had no effective firepower left,

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:43.800
they took refuge in Macedonia, another colony at Side 2.

00:01:44.360 --> 00:01:47.630
However, this space colony of Macedonia...

00:01:47.660 --> 00:01:50.730
...had fallen under the influence of the Zanscare Empire.

00:01:51.100 --> 00:01:53.860
THE GREAT ESCAPE

00:01:53.860 --> 00:01:55.400
"The Great Escape".
THE GREAT ESCAPE

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:56.530
THE GREAT ESCAPE

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:12.800
If anyone aboard the Reineforce Junior resists,

00:02:12.830 --> 00:02:14.560
I don't care if you shoot them!

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:16.430
Take all their weapons!

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:19.830
Don't resist! Let them take you prisoner.

00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:23.330
This space colony seems to be like Zanscare.

00:02:23.560 --> 00:02:26.800
Miss Junko... We'll always be together, right?

00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:30.160
Kid! Get your hands up and come over here!

00:02:32.730 --> 00:02:35.530
Keep those hands up, or I swear, I'll shoot!

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:38.060
Why are there kids on a warship?

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:46.160
Welcome to Macedonia.

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:50.300
You who continually resist the Zanscare Empire's Mariaism...

00:02:50.330 --> 00:02:55.230
...and are tired from battle, have drifted into our jurisdiction.

00:02:55.560 --> 00:02:59.100
I've heard that while Macedonia obeys Zanscare,

00:02:59.130 --> 00:03:02.860
there are still soldiers here who desire independence.

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:06.200
You will follow international law on the treatment of prisoners, I hope.

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:10.800
For your soldiers, but those in the League Militaire are guerrillas!

00:03:10.860 --> 00:03:12.230
You'll send them to the guillotine?

00:03:12.260 --> 00:03:14.130
For this many?

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:15.660
I'll have to think it over.

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:19.160
You will now be taken to a POW camp!

00:03:19.530 --> 00:03:22.700
Tomáš and Martina will never find us.

00:03:22.730 --> 00:03:24.860
At least we won't have to worry about food.

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:27.160
Right face! Right!

00:03:29.260 --> 00:03:33.460
Meanwhile, in Zanscare's space colony,

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:38.360
Cronicle Asher is given a brand new mission.

00:03:49.100 --> 00:03:51.030
Welcome, Commandant Cronicle!

00:03:51.430 --> 00:03:55.360
For risking your life to stop the Big Cannon,

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:58.530
you've been made commandant of the Motorad Space Fleet.

00:03:59.230 --> 00:04:02.300
I'll act as the chief of operations.

00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:04.500
Sorry to trouble you, sir.

00:04:04.530 --> 00:04:07.200
No more referring to me like a superior.

00:04:07.230 --> 00:04:07.900
Right!

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:13.530
Glad to see you, Miss.

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:18.130
The Motorad mobile suits are a bit different than you're used to.

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:19.700
I'm prepared for it.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:21.530
I look forward to serving with you.

00:04:23.230 --> 00:04:25.760
This soil's terrible. It has no taste.

00:04:28.360 --> 00:04:30.800
How many years do you plan on staying?

00:04:31.630 --> 00:04:35.600
I like farm work. So, are the rumors true?

00:04:35.760 --> 00:04:36.500
What?

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:38.000
The wedding.

00:04:38.160 --> 00:04:39.060
It's true.

00:04:39.230 --> 00:04:42.760
There's not much else to do in a prison, is there?

00:04:42.830 --> 00:04:47.300
You're so jealous, it's crazy! Do you even realize it?

00:04:47.530 --> 00:04:48.730
Of course I do!

00:04:50.460 --> 00:04:53.000
Let's tell everyone and have a big celebration!

00:04:53.030 --> 00:04:55.460
Yeah, everyone's feeling better now.

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:57.300
We have to plan a party.

00:04:57.360 --> 00:04:58.400
Yes, we should.

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:03.030
And since we need a present, we can use this.

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:06.500
Would you cut it out?!

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:09.630
Even if you old goats avoid getting the guillotine,

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:12.360
we're fixing up that captured ship and mobile suits...

00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:14.600
...to use in Macedonia's forces!

00:05:14.630 --> 00:05:17.800
That's illegal confiscation! Besides, we...

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.400
Did you say guillotine?

00:05:19.430 --> 00:05:20.830
Yeah, he did...

00:05:20.860 --> 00:05:22.560
Now, get back to work!

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:24.700
Oh, I'm scared!

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:28.060
If they're repairing the Reineforce...

00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:30.660
They're probably fixing the mobile suits, too.

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:32.560
Mr. Leonid!

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:35.200
Mr. Leonid, you're good at cooking, right?

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:37.060
Tell us how to plan for the party!

00:05:37.100 --> 00:05:38.200
What party?

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:41.100
The wedding! Marbet and Oliver's!

00:05:41.130 --> 00:05:43.930
Those two are finally getting married?

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:46.860
A wedding in a prison camp?

00:05:47.060 --> 00:05:49.600
I thought you guys were in the resistance.

00:05:51.230 --> 00:05:54.560
I haven't gotten to be a minister in ages.

00:05:54.830 --> 00:05:57.100
Üso must be happy, too.

00:05:57.330 --> 00:05:58.530
Where's Miss Marbet?!

00:05:58.630 --> 00:06:00.400
In the next shack over.

00:06:00.660 --> 00:06:02.500
What's he in such a rush for?

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:06.560
At the very least, I get the feeling he's against the wedding.

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:10.230
Miss Marbet!

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:15.200
Hey!

00:06:15.260 --> 00:06:16.300
Sorry!

00:06:17.160 --> 00:06:20.330
Are you really getting married, Miss Marbet?

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:24.260
When they see us celebrating, they'll lower their guard.

00:06:24.630 --> 00:06:26.360
All part of the plan.

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:28.830
So, it's a plan?

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:31.430
Do I look sufficiently bride-like?

00:06:31.460 --> 00:06:32.600
I don't like it!

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:36.100
You and Mr. Oliver getting married.

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:40.760
You'd rather I have your baby, Üso?

00:06:42.200 --> 00:06:43.930
That's not what I meant!

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:46.460
That's a good one, Marbet!

00:06:46.860 --> 00:06:49.630
Üso, someday you'll find someone nice for yourself.

00:06:49.660 --> 00:06:50.700
Miss Marbet?

00:06:54.400 --> 00:06:55.200
Here.

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:56.700
Thank you, Shahkti.

00:06:56.930 --> 00:06:59.330
It's okay. I'd like you to have the happiness...

00:06:59.360 --> 00:07:02.660
...Miss Junko and Miss Mahalia and the others couldn't.

00:07:02.700 --> 00:07:05.360
I worked hard to find those flowers.

00:07:08.460 --> 00:07:10.860
Yeah. Cony, too...

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:12.430
I know.

00:07:12.960 --> 00:07:15.260
That's why we've been working so hard on this.

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:16.660
I'm sorry.

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:23.200
Mr. Oliver!

00:07:24.030 --> 00:07:25.860
What's with the angry look?

00:07:25.900 --> 00:07:29.960
You're not doing this as a reaction to Miss Junko's death, are you?!

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:33.160
That's outrageous! Marbet and I have known each other for two years!

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:34.100
Fine!

00:07:36.030 --> 00:07:39.700
Acting so high and mighty, when's he's just jealous!

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:44.200
Hey, Preacher Man! Let's get this started!

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:45.930
The party's all set to go!

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:47.700
Woo! Fancy lad!

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:49.460
Where's this lovely lady been hiding?

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:52.230
Now, let's see what I should say here.

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:55.730
Hush, Karl.

00:07:55.860 --> 00:07:58.430
Man, they make a great couple!

00:07:58.660 --> 00:07:59.430
Haro!

00:08:00.030 --> 00:08:01.300
Haro's fixed?

00:08:02.600 --> 00:08:04.300
Now, you may kiss the bride.

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:06.660
C'mon, let's see it! Let's see it!

00:08:15.860 --> 00:08:18.000
Okay, let's see who'll be next!

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:23.100
You got it!

00:08:23.130 --> 00:08:24.460
Congratulations!

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:51.200
We're going to send out three Einerads as a test.

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:52.560
I appreciate it.

00:08:52.860 --> 00:08:54.800
I'll leave the new pilot to your call.

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:57.960
That's fine in front of the other soldiers.

00:08:58.000 --> 00:08:59.000
Sir!

00:08:59.030 --> 00:09:02.130
I've given detailed instructions to Lupe Cineau and Azis Baggi.

00:09:02.160 --> 00:09:04.130
Launch the Einerad Gedlav!

00:09:09.860 --> 00:09:12.730
Einerad Gedlav! Lupe Cineau, moving out!

00:09:16.960 --> 00:09:18.600
Azis Baggi, moving out!

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:23.500
Katejina Loos, Gedlav! Moving out!

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:34.600
Amazing. It feels just like the Einerad simulator.

00:09:36.660 --> 00:09:40.860
Ltjg. Azis Baggi, the little girl is still a rookie, okay?

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:43.730
Roger that, Lieutenant Lupe Cineau.

00:09:47.260 --> 00:09:48.900
They're going to test me.

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:58.960
We only wish to take back the girl Shahkti Kareen.

00:09:59.130 --> 00:10:01.100
Nothing else required besides that.

00:10:01.260 --> 00:10:03.760
No ship by the name of "Reineforce" made port here.

00:10:03.800 --> 00:10:06.660
How would this girl have gotten in here, then?

00:10:07.060 --> 00:10:08.160
Don't play dumb!

00:10:08.230 --> 00:10:12.230
We were able to trace the Reineforce Junior's trail, too!

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:14.300
You won't listen to me, then?

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:20.330
My government recognizes the importance of the mother of Mariaism,

00:10:20.360 --> 00:10:23.760
but I don't recall accepting rule by the Zanscare Empire!

00:10:24.700 --> 00:10:25.860
Well played.

00:10:26.460 --> 00:10:28.660
This'll pull the rug out from under them.

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:32.730
Einerad Gedlavs, begin initial operation!

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:36.430
Roger. Right on schedule, Lieutenant Lupe.

00:10:36.460 --> 00:10:37.860
Understood, Azis.

00:10:38.630 --> 00:10:42.160
Time to give Cronicle's woman some on the job training.

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:46.660
Shahkti, wait for me.

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:51.100
Since you'll be queen one day, I'll save you!

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:15.860
Hey! That way, more!

00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:17.900
C'mon, let's not do this.

00:11:18.100 --> 00:11:21.260
Üso, aren't you worried about Miss Marbet?

00:11:28.300 --> 00:11:29.830
What are you doing?!

00:11:29.960 --> 00:11:31.160
You idiots!

00:11:31.230 --> 00:11:33.430
Shh! Kill the lights!

00:11:34.730 --> 00:11:38.500
They gave the newlyweds a special new room, right? Over there!

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:40.300
Oh, I get you!

00:11:40.860 --> 00:11:43.660
You're way too young to have thoughts like that, kid!

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:47.960
He hasn't forgotten about Operation Swipe, has he?

00:11:48.860 --> 00:11:50.030
Take a crap and go to bed!

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:50.960
Yes, sir.

00:11:57.160 --> 00:11:58.060
Get 'em!

00:12:01.860 --> 00:12:04.900
Dammit! A truck coming in the middle of the night?!

00:12:04.930 --> 00:12:06.630
Hey, hurry up and open it!

00:12:06.760 --> 00:12:08.430
What do you want at this hour?

00:12:08.730 --> 00:12:09.600
What's up?

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:10.730
Apparently there's someone from Zanscare with them that they want back.

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:12.330
Hey! Üso!

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:13.960
Apparently there's someone from Zanscare with them that they want back.

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:15.660
A girl named Shahkti Kareen.

00:12:15.730 --> 00:12:16.560
Shahkti?

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:19.100
They're here just for Shahkti?

00:12:19.230 --> 00:12:19.800
Why?

00:12:19.830 --> 00:12:20.930
How should I know?

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:26.660
What's that siren about?

00:12:27.530 --> 00:12:28.630
An air raid siren?

00:12:29.160 --> 00:12:30.460
Do you see Odelo and the others?

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:31.230
No.

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:32.660
Let's go.

00:12:33.530 --> 00:12:34.260
Dear?

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:37.730
Do you regret marrying me?

00:12:38.200 --> 00:12:39.660
Of course not!

00:12:39.700 --> 00:12:42.230
Really? I mean, everyone on Shrike Team...

00:12:42.600 --> 00:12:44.060
You're still saying stuff like that?

00:12:44.330 --> 00:12:46.860
You're the only one I want as my life partner.

00:12:48.130 --> 00:12:48.960
I love you.

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:52.760
Think it's an uprising?

00:12:53.200 --> 00:12:57.030
Doubt it, but things look tense between Macedonia and Zanscare.

00:12:57.800 --> 00:12:59.730
I don't see anything.

00:13:01.630 --> 00:13:04.660
You don't think reinforcements from the League Militaire have come, do you?

00:13:05.030 --> 00:13:08.730
There's no way. Even the Side 2 allied fleet...

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:13.930
Hey! We're stealing that wappa.

00:13:16.300 --> 00:13:18.360
What's the fuss with the siren?

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:19.960
None of your concern!

00:13:20.300 --> 00:13:23.560
You have a girl named Shahkti Kareen with you?

00:13:23.630 --> 00:13:24.430
Where is she?!

00:13:24.760 --> 00:13:28.000
Shahkti's in that shack. What's this about?

00:13:28.360 --> 00:13:29.530
Take me to her!

00:13:31.860 --> 00:13:33.200
Why, you!

00:13:38.730 --> 00:13:41.060
What?! The enemy's bombing us?!

00:13:41.160 --> 00:13:43.360
We've got a riot starting over here!

00:13:43.400 --> 00:13:44.500
You!

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:47.560
Steal the trucks! Scatter! Kill the lights!

00:13:50.630 --> 00:13:51.500
Something's coming!

00:13:51.530 --> 00:13:53.230
Get away from the buildings!

00:13:55.660 --> 00:13:56.430
What was that?

00:13:57.030 --> 00:13:59.660
Mobile suits riding in tires?!

00:14:03.300 --> 00:14:04.860
This is a POW camp!

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:25.960
Pretty good, Rich Girl!

00:14:26.160 --> 00:14:29.630
Next, we take out the Macedonia military's facilities.

00:14:35.130 --> 00:14:36.130
Incoming!

00:14:38.900 --> 00:14:40.700
Isn't she getting carried away?

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:44.730
I understand wanting to test the new mobile suits, but...

00:14:48.500 --> 00:14:50.960
I won't be a newbie forever!

00:14:58.060 --> 00:15:00.400
There are mobile suits in those tires!

00:15:03.360 --> 00:15:06.360
I've never heard of this type! Where did they come from?

00:15:07.160 --> 00:15:10.030
Is it the League Militaire, snooping around for something?

00:15:10.500 --> 00:15:13.200
Or did Cronicle send them?!

00:15:13.630 --> 00:15:14.700
Halt!

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:22.430
Where did these tires come from?

00:15:36.400 --> 00:15:38.500
The little girl isn't bad.

00:15:42.100 --> 00:15:43.760
Don't underestimate us!

00:15:48.200 --> 00:15:50.960
This is another elevator and escalator station.

00:15:51.230 --> 00:15:53.530
Okay, we'll enter the port from here.

00:15:54.330 --> 00:15:56.860
We've got one last elevator tonight.

00:15:57.060 --> 00:15:59.460
Great. 80 tickets, please.

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:01.060
80 tickets?!

00:16:02.360 --> 00:16:03.430
What's...

00:16:04.130 --> 00:16:08.660
I suppose 93 is more accurate. Not really sure, though!

00:16:09.930 --> 00:16:12.130
We're going to fire up the engines...

00:16:12.160 --> 00:16:14.430
...of the Reineforce Junior in the dock.

00:16:14.930 --> 00:16:17.660
And what about the captured mobile suits...

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:19.760
...they have on display in their central plaza?

00:16:19.800 --> 00:16:21.460
We'll recover them!

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:24.100
They're after Shahkti. Protect her, okay?

00:16:24.400 --> 00:16:25.560
What are you going to do?

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:28.560
I'm going with Mr. Oliver and the others...

00:16:28.600 --> 00:16:31.330
...to get the mobile suits in the plaza.

00:16:31.560 --> 00:16:32.600
I'm coming, too!

00:16:32.630 --> 00:16:35.130
No, you have to protect the hostage.

00:16:35.560 --> 00:16:37.100
What hostage?

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:41.230
Look, the Macedonia military wants to use Shahkti, right?

00:16:41.360 --> 00:16:45.660
So, if we say we won't hand her over, we're treating her as a hostage.

00:16:45.830 --> 00:16:46.860
Protect her!

00:16:47.030 --> 00:16:48.330
It's logical, but...

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:50.630
It's okay to think of me like that.

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:51.530
Let's go!

00:16:51.560 --> 00:16:52.300
Haro!

00:16:56.500 --> 00:17:00.530
Those giant tires didn't come for these, did they?

00:17:06.060 --> 00:17:08.260
I want you to bear my child.

00:17:08.900 --> 00:17:12.300
When they see those monster tires, the guards will be thrown into confusion.

00:17:12.560 --> 00:17:13.930
We'll wait for that moment!

00:17:14.960 --> 00:17:15.730
Üso!

00:17:17.560 --> 00:17:18.400
Here they come!

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:19.430
The tires!

00:17:23.830 --> 00:17:26.660
Oliver, I will bear your child.

00:17:27.060 --> 00:17:27.700
Thank you.

00:17:28.760 --> 00:17:29.560
Stay away!

00:17:29.600 --> 00:17:31.360
Üso, get in the Victory!

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:34.030
Get in the Victory!

00:17:34.300 --> 00:17:35.060
Yes, ma'am!

00:17:37.460 --> 00:17:39.500
There's no point using our rifles!

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:40.700
Here they come again!

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:46.930
Mr. Oliver's child?

00:17:48.200 --> 00:17:48.960
Miss Marbet!

00:17:49.400 --> 00:17:50.200
Ready?

00:17:50.230 --> 00:17:50.960
Right!

00:17:52.030 --> 00:17:54.960
Fine, but if you hurt her, I'll get mad!

00:18:01.000 --> 00:18:04.660
The tire here has stopped! Where are the defense forces?!

00:18:04.800 --> 00:18:06.600
Where did the prisoners go?

00:18:06.630 --> 00:18:08.960
They ran away, thanks to you people!

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:11.100
You can find them!

00:18:11.130 --> 00:18:13.660
I'm gonna remember that attitude!

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:20.430
Defend the mobile suits and this plaza!

00:18:20.460 --> 00:18:22.600
What unit has started them up?

00:18:23.230 --> 00:18:25.530
We can't all get up to the port at the same time!

00:18:25.560 --> 00:18:28.860
That doesn't mean you have to play decoy by yourself!

00:18:29.130 --> 00:18:33.230
I can't let anything happen to Mr. Oliver's wife, can I?!

00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:36.000
Üso! Oliver...

00:18:36.530 --> 00:18:40.160
Üso's right. Don't disregard what that kid says.

00:18:44.030 --> 00:18:46.860
There, you see? Cony! Juca! Marbet!

00:18:47.100 --> 00:18:47.730
Yeah!

00:18:47.760 --> 00:18:48.530
I see it!

00:18:52.660 --> 00:18:55.330
Are they serious?! Inside a space colony?!

00:18:55.960 --> 00:18:57.260
This explosion...

00:18:57.860 --> 00:19:00.660
Cony, Juca, we can only use sabers!

00:19:07.130 --> 00:19:09.330
Tires don't fly through the sky!

00:19:14.060 --> 00:19:15.330
Marbet!

00:19:18.500 --> 00:19:19.560
What?!

00:19:20.900 --> 00:19:23.700
I still have to take control of the port.

00:19:28.960 --> 00:19:30.730
Over here! Notice me!

00:19:33.300 --> 00:19:34.500
That got a reaction.

00:19:39.160 --> 00:19:39.930
Here it comes!

00:19:45.300 --> 00:19:47.830
We're in the center of the city! Will it still come?

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:03.500
Didn't the Macedonians fix this thing properly?!

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:09.300
Why's there a dead end?!

00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:10.530
Dead end!

00:20:14.660 --> 00:20:16.860
Why can't you open quickly?!

00:20:35.060 --> 00:20:36.300
Is that you, Üso?

00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:38.630
Only you'd do something this reckless.

00:20:38.760 --> 00:20:40.930
Show me where Shahkti is!

00:20:47.630 --> 00:20:50.960
I need to buy more time! Follow me!

00:20:55.860 --> 00:20:57.060
Come on!

00:21:06.060 --> 00:21:11.330
You... You know I can't attack, Tire Suit?

00:21:17.100 --> 00:21:18.860
Nice job, little girl.

00:21:19.160 --> 00:21:22.860
Now, crush the pilot so that the engine doesn't explode!

00:21:23.860 --> 00:21:28.260
You enjoy tormenting me? That's sick! Just get it over with!

00:21:31.830 --> 00:21:34.400
This mobile suit... It's hesitating.

00:21:35.060 --> 00:21:38.060
Who's in there?! Is it you?!

00:21:38.160 --> 00:21:39.830
Is it you, Miss Katejina?!

00:21:40.060 --> 00:21:42.230
Miss Katejina Loos from Uwig!

00:21:42.400 --> 00:21:46.930
It has to be! Otherwise, you'd have killed me by now!

00:21:46.960 --> 00:21:48.860
You never shut up.

00:21:48.900 --> 00:21:50.460
What's the holdup, little girl?!

00:21:50.800 --> 00:21:54.500
Right, um... This pilot may be a Newtype.

00:21:54.530 --> 00:21:55.530
Newtype?!

00:21:55.560 --> 00:21:56.300
Yes.

00:21:56.730 --> 00:21:58.160
He's just a kid!

00:21:58.660 --> 00:22:01.830
Are you saying that's why he may be a Newtype?

00:23:31.230 --> 00:23:34.330
While we've retaken the ship,

00:23:34.830 --> 00:23:38.230
Üso is captured by a lady named Lupe Cineau,

00:23:38.360 --> 00:23:40.500
and undergoes terrible torture!

00:23:41.630 --> 00:23:44.460
Barely escaping into space with his life,

00:23:44.900 --> 00:23:49.460
Üso must board a new Gundam while completely naked!

00:23:49.860 --> 00:23:52.960
Next time, on Mobile Suit Victory Gundam:

00:23:53.530 --> 00:23:56.360
Next Episode THE NEW SUIT: V2
"The New Suit: V2".

00:23:56.360 --> 00:23:56.400
Next Episode THE NEW SUIT: V2

00:23:56.400 --> 00:23:57.630
Please watch it!
